SUMMARY:Nov 9th MIH Rehearsal at Mission
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nWith Men in Harmony at our a cappella vocal wo
 rkshops\, you can explore your vocal abilities by joining us for an intera
 ctive session that covers vocal training\, a cappella techniques\, and gro
 up singing tips. Our experienced director will guide you through the basic
 s of harmonizing\, breath control\, and performance skills. Get ready to d
 iscover the joy of making music together in a supportive environment. Come
  join us for an evening of fun songs and tags!\n**LOCATION\, DAY and TIME!
 **\n**Come early for Barbershop Polecats and tag singing!!**\n\nMission Ca
 ncer Center\, 21 Hospital Drive. NOT the main Hospital!\n**Entrance to bui
 lding parking is** on the Right side of the building\, off Hamiton St. An 
 **immediate LEFT is** where the BIG Parking lot is located. Come into the 
 building **on the floor level**\, into the lobby and there is a corridor o
 n the right where the conference rooms are. **We'll be rehearsing in confe
 rence room R122.**\n**NOTE: Please be on time as the outer doors will be l
 ocked after we start rehearsal.**
